stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> queued: 创建任务
 queued --> running: worker领取租约
 running --> running: 租约过期后重新领取
 running --> waiting_student: 等待作答或观察
 running --> needs_review: 证据不足或需补充
 running --> completed: 当前任务目标完成
 running --> failed: 计算或提交失败
 waiting_student --> queued: 有效学生动作
 needs_review --> queued: 有效继续动作
 failed --> queued: 允许重试且预算未耗尽
 queued --> cancelled: 学生主动结束
 running --> cancelled: 学生主动结束
 waiting_student --> cancelled: 学生主动结束
 needs_review --> cancelled: 学生主动结束
 failed --> cancelled: 学生主动结束
 queued --> stale: 原题依据变更
 running --> stale: 原题依据变更
 waiting_student --> stale: 原题依据变更
 needs_review --> stale: 原题依据变更
 failed --> stale: 原题依据变更
 completed --> stale: 查询时发现来源变更
 completed --> [*]
 cancelled --> [*]
 stale --> [*]
